ic planning to diagramming and meeting planning."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"57-what-are-some-popular-online-whiteboard-templates"},"What are some popular online whiteboard templates?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"You can kickstart your ideas with hundreds of free online whiteboard templates. Some of the most popular ones include:"),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/project-kickoff-template/"},"Project kickoff template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/flow-chart-template/"},"Flowchart template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/team-meeting-agenda-template/"},"Team meeting template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/customer-journey-map/"},"Customer journey map template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/daily-stand-up-meeting-template/"},"Standup template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/project-retrospective-template/"},"Retrospective template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/agile-roadmap-template/"},"Roadmap review template")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/timeline-template/"},"Project timeline template")))),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"58-how-can-i-copy-a-flowchart-on-figjams-online-whiteboard"},"How can I copy a flowchart on FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"To copy a FigJam flowchart, drag your cursor around the entire flowchart, right-click, and then hit Group selection or Command + G on your keyboard. This will ensure your entire flowchart is grouped, making it easier to copy. Once you\u2019ve made your selection, click the flowchart and hit Command + C on your keyboard or right-click and hit Copy."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"If you want to copy individual objects or symbols on your flowchart, click the item you want to copy and hit Command + C on your keyboard, or right-click and hit Copy."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"You can also make a copy of your flowchart for others to use by adding it to the"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/"},"Figma Community"),". To do this, click the Share button in the top right corner of your board, then click Publish to Community. You must have \u201CCan edit\u201D access to publish the file to the Community."," "),n.createElement("p",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/360040035974-Publish-files-to-the-Community"},"Learn more about how to publish files to the Figma Community"),"."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"59-can-i-create-a-flowchart-with-specific-symbols-on-my-online-whiteboard"},"Can I create a flowchart with specific symbols on my online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Absolutely! Flowchart symbols are shapes, lines, and arrows that represent actions or processes on your flowchart diagram. For example, a diamond shape symbolizes points where decisions are made, rectangles signify a specific action or step needed to carry out a process, and parallelograms show where users input or output data."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard has over 20 shapes and symbols you can use to build a flowchart that maps user flows, systems, and processes. Read FigJam\u2019s"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/flowchart-symbols/"},"flowchart symbol guide")," ","to learn more about what each symbol means and how to effectively use them."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"60-do-i-have-to-start-my-work-with-the-ready-made-online-flowchart"},"Do I have to start my work with the ready-made online flowchart?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"You can start your flowchart with ready-made templates or start from scratch and build your own using shapes, lines, and connectors on the FigJam whiteboard. You can also use FigJam\u2019s Generate tool, which uses the power of AI to create a customized flowchart based on the prompt you input."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"61-can-i-add-sticky-notes-to-my-flowchart-board"},"Can I add sticky notes to my flowchart board?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"You can add sticky notes anywhere on your board when building a flowchart. Press S on your keyboard or click the stack of stickies on the bottom toolbar, then click the area of your flowchart where you\u2019d like to drop the sticky."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"You can also add connectors between sticky notes to visualize flows and create paths. Click the connector icon on the toolbar, or hit Shift + C to create an elbow connector or L for a straight line. Then, click and drag your cursor between the stickies you want to connect."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"62-can-i-add-text-to-my-flowchart"},"Can I add text to my flowchart?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Shapes already come with the option to add text, making it easy to add text and labels when"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/how-to-create-a-flow-chart/"},"building your flowchart"),". When resizing a shape, use the text option in the toolbar to adjust the text or make any other formatting changes to enhance readability."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"63-can-i-undoredo-something-on-my-flowchart"},"Can I undo/redo something on my flowchart?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Of course! To undo something on your flowchart, hit Command + Z on your keyboard. Or, navigate to the main menu in the upper left corner, click the Figma symbol, edit, and select undo. If you want to delete an object on your flowchart, hit the Delete button on your keyboard or right-click the flowchart object and hit Delete."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"To redo something, click Shift + Command + Z on your keyboard or select edit, then redo on the main menu."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"64-how-do-i-connect-shapes-and-symbols-on-my-flowchart-online"},"How do I connect shapes and symbols on my flowchart online?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Use lines and connectors located on the bottom toolbar to connect shapes and symbols on your flowchart. Lines automatically snap onto the shapes and stickies you select, allowing you to move the object around the board without disrupting the connector."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"To speed up the flowchart process, use"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500004291601-Build-faster-with-quick-create-in-FigJam#Quick_create_shapes"},"quick create")," ","to automatically connect shapes as you\u2019re creating them."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"65-what-is-the-meaning-of-the-flowchart-symbols"},"What is the meaning of the flowchart symbols?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Flowchart symbols visually represent each step, action, or order in a process. Every symbol has a different meaning, making it easier for teams to understand and analyze processes."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"The most common flowchart symbols are: "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Decision:")," a diamond shape to represent any point where a decision is made"," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Action:")," a rectangle shape to symbolize any step or action in a process"," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Terminator:")," an oval symbol marking the first and last step in a process"," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Input/output:")," a parallelogram to show when data enters or leaves"," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Directional flow:")," arrows and lines representing the directional path between steps or actions")),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard tool comes with all the shapes, symbols, and connectors you need to build even the most complex flowcharts."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"66-what-flowchart-symbols-are-available"},"What flowchart symbols are available?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Some of the available flowchart symbols FigJam offers include: "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,"Predefined process "),n.createElement("li",null,"Document "),n.createElement("li",null,"Multiple documents "),n.createElement("li",null,"Manual input "),n.createElement("li",null,"Hexagon "),n.createElement("li",null,"Right-leaning parallelogram "),n.createElement("li",null,"Left-leaning parallelogram "),n.createElement("li",null,"Cylinder "),n.createElement("li",null,"Horizontal cylinder "),n.createElement("li",null,"Internal storage "),n.createElement("li",null,"Trapezoid "),n.createElement("li",null,"Summing junction "),n.createElement("li",null,"Or "),n.createElement("li",null,"Shield "),n.createElement("li",null,"Folder "),n.createElement("li",null,"File")),n.createElement("p",null,"To explore the flowchart symbols FigJam offers, click the shapes on the bottom toolbar, then click Flowchart on the dropdown menu."," "),n.createElement("p",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500004414382-Visualize-information-using-shapes-with-text"},"Learn more about visualizing information and building flowcharts with shapes"),"."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"67-how-can-i-access-additional-flowcharting-features"},"How can I access additional flowcharting features?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Aside from building using pre-made flowchart templates or building your own flowchart with shapes and symbols, FigJam\u2019s AI feature allows you to generate customized flowcharts in seconds."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"In the top toolbar, click Generate, then choose Flowchart and add a prompt to specify any unique symbols or features you\u2019d like to add to your diagram. The more specific, the better. Once you\u2019ve nailed your prompt, hit the Generate button and watch the magic happen."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"68-will-i-know-who-made-changes-to-my-online-flowchart"},"Will I know who made changes to my online flowchart?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"To see who\u2019s made changes to your online flowchart, click File, then View version history in the upper left corner of your board. From there, you can see who\u2019s made changes to the flowchart and when."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"To revert any changes and restore a version of your flowchart, click the three dots next to the autosaved version, then hit Restore this version. You can also name each version to make it easier to track any changes made."," ")))}function tI(){return n.createElement("div",{className:t_},n.createElement("h1",{className:th,id:"using-your-online-whiteboard"},n.createElement("strong",null,"Using your online whiteboard")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"1-what-is-an-online-whiteboard"},"What is an online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"An online whiteboard is a visual collaboration tool for teams that recreates the feeling of working together in person."),n.createElement("p",null,"Unlike digital documents or slides, online whiteboards provide teams space to think outside the constraints of margins and text boxes. Plus, you can express yourself and interact with teammates live on the board, making conversations more human, dynamic, and productive.")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"2-what-is-figjam"},"What is FigJam?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam is an online whiteboard tool that offers an easy way for individuals, teams, and organizations to collaborate on projects like brainstorming, project planning, design, and meetings. With its easy-to-use collaboration features, FigJam encourages users to contribute, offer feedback, and engage with team members in real time."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"3-is-figjams-online-whiteboard-tool-free"},"Is FigJam's online whiteboard tool free?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})," "),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam is an online whiteboard that can be used for free forever with unlimited collaborators in three editable files. Paid plans start at just $5 per user per month, less than a third of the cost of Miro and Mural."," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam-vs-miro/"},"Compare FigJam to Miro"),"."),n.createElement("p",null,"To learn more about FigJam plans, visit the"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/pricing/#figjam"},"pricing page"),"."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"4-are-online-whiteboards-only-for-brainstorming"},"Are online whiteboards only for brainstorming?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})," "),n.createElement("p",null,"Collaborative online whiteboards like FigJam make all types of activities more inclusive, productive, and fun, including"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/diagramming-tool/"},"diagramming"),", journey mapping,"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/strategic-planning/"},"strategic planning"),","," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/agile-workflows/"},"agile workflows"),", and facilitating ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam/team-meetings/"},"team meetings")," ","and workshops.")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"5-can-i-make-online-presentations-with-figjam"},"Can I make online presentations with FigJam?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})," "),n.createElement("p",null,"While FigJam isn't a traditional presentation tool, its interactive features make it a great tool for presenting ideas and engaging in conversations with teams. Whether you're holding a design retrospective or brainstorming session, you can invite team members to view and follow your board using the Spotlight and audio call feature."," "),n.createElement("p",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/slides/"},"Learn more about creating presentations with Figma Slides"),"."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"6-can-i-use-the-online-whiteboard-to-take-meeting-notes"},"Can I use the online whiteboard to take meeting notes?"),n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Yes. Use sticky notes, shapes, or text boxes to add your thoughts. Format your text using a bulleted or numbered list, then use the marker or highlighter to draw attention to important information."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam's"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/meeting-notes-template/"},"meeting notes template")," ","is a great starting point for jotting down important takeaways and organizing your notes."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"7-can-i-use-the-online-whiteboard-for-personal-projects"},"Can I use the online whiteboard for personal projects?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Yes! FigJam is a free tool to use for personal, professional, or educational projects. Since the online whiteboard is so versatile, it's easy to use for various personal projects or tasks like organizing weekly tasks, studying for exams, setting goals, or journaling your thoughts."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"8-can-i-use-figjam-digital-whiteboards-with-conferencing-platforms"},"Can I use FigJam digital whiteboards with conferencing platforms?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam integrates with many popular conferencing platforms to make it easy to present your whiteboard without leaving your conferencing tool. Learn more about how to integrate FigJam with the following platforms:"," "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/17720082601751-Figma-and-Zoom"},"FigJam and Zoom")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/16921722048151-Figma-and-Google-Meet"},"FigJam and Google Meet")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/7405452518423-Figma-and-Microsoft-Teams"},"FigJam and Microsoft Teams")," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500002613622-P2-and-Figma"},"FigJam and P2")))),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"9-what-is-the-difference-between-figjam-and-miro"},"What is the difference between FigJam and Miro?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam and Miro are both online whiteboards, but they have a few distinct differences."),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Price.")," Both tools offer free plans, but FigJam's paid plan is $5 per user per month, while Miro's starts at $8 per user per month."),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Features.")," Miro offers customizable features, while FigJam has fun and user-friendly features like stickers, emotes, high-fives, and cursor chat to cater to all user levels."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Integrations.")," FigJam is the only online collaboration tool that connects to Figma and other tools product and design teams count on to streamline workflows.")),n.createElement("p",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/figjam-vs-miro/"},"Learn more about the difference between FigJam and Miro."))),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"10-how-can-i-learn-more-about-figjam"},"How can I learn more about FigJam?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us"},"Figma's Learn Center")," is a great place to learn more about FigJam's features, use cases, and best practices. Or, open a blank whiteboard to play around with the different features FigJam has to offer."),n.createElement("p",null,"Explore"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/resource-library/"},"Figma's Resource Library")," for tips and tricks on how FigJam can help with brainstorming, strategic planning, diagramming, and more.")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"11-which-online-whiteboard-is-best-suited-for-teaching"},"Which online whiteboard is best suited for teaching?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam is the best online whiteboard to enhance teaching and learning experiences in the classroom. Its user-friendly interface and fun features make it easy to navigate for all education levels. The shared workspace allows students to participate in discussions, contribute ideas, and offer feedback to their classmates."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"The drawing and shape tools enhance visual learning by offering an easy way to build diagrams, flowcharts, and drawings, making understanding complex topics simple. Since FigJam is an online whiteboard, it's great for remote and virtual learning environments since students can participate from anywhere."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"12-how-do-i-teach-with-an-online-whiteboard"},"How do I teach with an online whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Teachers from K\u201312 to higher education love using FigJam to facilitate collaborative classroom discussions, brainstorms, and group work."," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/education/"},"FigJam's open sessions are available on education plans, allowing you to temporarily invite people to interact with your board even if they don't have a Figma account. This is great for educators looking to host small workshops or feedback sessions with their students.")," "),n.createElement("p",null,n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/education/"},"Learn more about using FigJam for education"),".")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"13-how-do-i-draw-with-an-online-whiteboard"},"How do I draw with an online whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Online whiteboards are great for doodling, sketching ideas and wireframes, and taking visual notes. Use FigJam's marker tool on desktop or, for more polished drawing, with the Apple Pencil in the free FigJam iPad app."),n.createElement("p",null,"If working between devices, copy and paste drawings from your iPad to your computer and vice versa. Once you've copied your selection, select paste from the notification banner on the other device."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"14-how-can-i-add-a-section-to-my-online-whiteboard"},"How can I add a section to my online whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Sections are a great way to organize and group related objects together on your online whiteboard. To add a section to your board, click the section icon on the bottom toolbar or use the shortcut Shift + S on your keyboard. To keep things organized, rename your section in the box at the top left corner."),n.createElement("p",null,"If you want to select multiple objects and group them into a section, click and drag your cursor over the objects, then right-click your selection and hit Create section."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"If you want to hide a section without removing it from your board, select the section, then click the eye icon to hide the content. Click the same icon to reveal the content once ready. If you need to delete the section altogether, simply select the section and hit the Delete or backspace button on your keyboard."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"15-what-are-the-text-options-for-my-online-whiteboard"},"What are the text options for my online whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Whether creating a text box or editing text on an object, sticky note, or shape, a text toolbar will appear, allowing you to change the text properties. On the toolbar, you can update the following properties:"),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Typeface.")," Simple, bookish, technical, and scribbled are the four types of FigJam fonts you can choose to match the style of your board."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Text size.")," Choose between the small, medium, large, extra large, or huge preset text sizes, or customize your font size by inputting a specific point size."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Bold and strikethrough.")," You can apply the bold property to help text stand out or the strikethrough property to cross off tasks or ideas during meetings or brainstorming sessions."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Lists.")," Create bulleted lists or numbered lists to organize to-do lists, notes, or instructions on your board."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Text color.")," Make text pop by changing the font color to any of the color options in the dropdown on the toolbar."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Alignment.")," Align text to the left, right, or center using the alignment option in the text toolbar."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Links.")," Add clickable links to other FigJam boards, documents, Figma files, or websites by highlighting the text and pressing the Link button on the toolbar."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Markdown.")," Easily format any text using Markdown syntax. Learn more about the Markdown syntax FigJam supports"," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500004291281-Create-text-and-links-in-FigJam#h_01HAQ9NYM8AYGY1W88Q4W58ST2"},"here"),"."))),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"16-how-do-connection-lines-work-on-my-online-whiteboards"},"How do connection lines work on my online whiteboards?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Connectors and lines in FigJam let you create paths and signify relationships between board items, outline steps, or organize information. They're great for building out flowcharts, mind maps, user flows, and other diagrams."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"There are two types of lines you can use in FigJam: "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Elbowed connectors.")," These connectors can wrap around other objects to create an indirect path to other objects on the board."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Straight lines.")," These create a straight path or line from one object to another. They can also be used to create simple arrows on your whiteboard.")),n.createElement("p",null,"To add lines to your whiteboard, click the shapes on your bottom toolbar, then click Connector or Straight line. To connect objects or shapes on your board, click and drag your cursor between the objects you want to connect."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"17-can-i-rotate-or-resize-an-uploaded-file"},"Can I rotate or resize an uploaded file?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"Rotating and resizing uploaded image files on your whiteboard is simple. To resize an image, click and drag the bounding box around the image to get it to your desired proportions. To rotate the image, click the file, then hit the Crop image button that's located on the popup toolbar. From there, you can rotate the image or change its aspect ratio."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"You can also bring Figma designs into FigJam with the ability to move, flip, rotate, or rearrange the objects on your board."," ",n.createElement(tm.N,{href:"https://help.figma.com/hc/articles/1500005916661-Work-between-Figma-and-FigJam"},"Learn more about working between Figma and FigJam"),"."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"Adding images and design files to your FigJam whiteboard can make it easy to check in on design progress during team meetings or add personalization to mood boards, team chats, and brainstorming sessions."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"18-do-the-online-whiteboards-have-undoredo-functionality"},"Do the online whiteboards have undo/redo functionality?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam's online whiteboard has both undo and redo functionalities, making it quick and easy to reverse or repeat actions."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"To undo an action, use the Command + Z shortcut on your keyboard or click Edit, then Undo on the top left menu bar. To redo actions, hit Command + Shift + Z on your keyboard, or select Edit then Redo in the menu bar."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"20-how-can-i-add-text-to-my-whiteboard"},"How can I add text to my whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"To add text to your whiteboard, click the Text button on the bottom toolbar, then select the area where you'd like to add the text box. Once selected, a toolbar will appear, allowing you to adjust the text size, font, color, and more."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"22-how-can-i-copy-objects-on-my-online-whiteboard"},"How can I copy objects on my online whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"To copy objects on your whiteboard, select the object you want to copy, then press Command + C on your keyboard or right-click the object and hit Copy. You can also copy layers and objects from Figma files using the same instructions. Once you've copied the item from your Figma file, open your FigJam file and paste the copied selection into your whiteboard."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"23-how-can-i-give-a-title-to-my-figjam-virtual-whiteboard"},"How can I give a title to my FigJam virtual whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"By default, your board will be named \u201CUntitled.\u201D To edit this, go to the upper left corner, then double-click the board title and rename it. You can also rename your board by navigating to the Drafts tab of your Figma files, right-clicking the board, and then hitting Rename."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:tg},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:tf,id:"24-how-do-i-change-the-name-of-my-online-whiteboard"},"How do I change the name of my online whiteboard?")," ",n.createElement(tp.k,{className:tE})),n.createElement("p",null,"To change the name of your online whiteboard, double-click the title on the menu bar in the upper left corner, then rename your board. You can also right-click the draft under your files and select Rename to update your 